Path\(id\): Timing\(ns\)/Thread cycles/Instrs/Fnops/Blocks/Pausable/Executions/Absolute
\+COMPLETE \[2 path\(s\)\]
    pathi\(\d+\)\s+: \d+\.\d+/\d+/\d+/\d+/\d+/0/1/0, path\(\d+\)
        \+loopi\(0\) \[1 path\(s\)\, 0 iteration\(s\)\, loop\(0\)]
            pathi\(\d+\)\s+: \d+\.\d+/\d+/\d+/\d+/2/0/0/0, path\(\d+\)
    pathi\(\d+\)\s+: \d+\.\d+/\d+/\d+/\d+/\d+/0/1/0, path\(\d+\)
        \+loopi\(1\) \[1 path\(s\)\, 0 iteration\(s\)\, loop\(0\)]
            pathi\(\d+\)\s+: \d+\.\d+/\d+/\d+/\d+/2/0/0/0, path\(\d+\)
